                                                                                            <span class="inventory-card-condition ${model.damaged ? 'is-damaged' : 'is-good'}"><i class="bi ${model.damaged ? 'bi-exclamation-triangle-fill' : 'bi-check-circle-fill'}"></i>${escapeHtml(model.condition)}</span>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-card-number">${model.number}</span>
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-product-body">
                                                                                            <span class="dashboard-category-badge">${escapeHtml(model.category)}</span>
                                                                                            <strong class="inventory-product-name">${escapeHtml(model.name)}</strong>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-product-serial">SN : ${escapeHtml(model.serial)}</span>
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-product-meta">
                                                                                                <span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i><span><small>Jumlah</small><b>${model.quantity} ${model.unit}</b></span></span>
                                                                                                <span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i><span><small>Lokasi</small><b>${escapeHtml(model.location)}</b></span></span>
                                                                                            </div>
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-secondary-row">
                                                                                                <span class="inventory-meta-item inventory-meta-date"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i><span><small>Tanggal</small><b>${escapeHtml(model.date)}</b></span></span>
                                                                                                <span class="inventory-product-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i><span><small>Keterangan</small><b>${escapeHtml(model.note)}</b></span></span>
                                                                                            </div>
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                        <footer>${renderInventoryActions(model, true)}</footer>
                                                                                    </article>`).join('') : '';

                                                                                compact.innerHTML = currentViewMode === 'compact' ? models.map(model => `
                                                                                    <article class="inventory-compact-card" data-item-index="${model.index}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Lihat detail ${escapeHtml(model.name)}">
                                                                                        <span class="inventory-compact-number">${model.number}</span>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-compact-image">${renderInventoryImage(model)}</div>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-compact-copy">
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-compact-topline"><span class="dashboard-category-badge">${escapeHtml(model.category)}</span><time>Tanggal · ${escapeHtml(model.date)}</time></div>
                                                                                            <strong>${escapeHtml(model.name)}</strong>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-product-serial">SN : ${escapeHtml(model.serial)}</span>
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-product-meta"><span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i><span><small>Jumlah</small><b>${model.quantity} ${model.unit}</b></span></span><span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i><span><small>Lokasi</small><b>${escapeHtml(model.location)}</b></span></span></div>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-product-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>${escapeHtml(model.note)}</span>
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-compact-side">
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-card-condition ${model.damaged ? 'is-damaged' : 'is-good'}">${escapeHtml(model.condition)}</span>
                                                                                            ${renderInventoryActions(model, false)}
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </article>`).join('') : '';

                                                                                list.innerHTML = currentViewMode === 'list' ? models.map(model => `
                                                                                    <article class="inventory-list-card" data-item-index="${model.index}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Lihat detail ${escapeHtml(model.name)}">
                                                                                        <span class="inventory-list-number">${model.number}</span>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-list-image">${renderInventoryImage(model)}</div>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-list-copy">
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-list-heading"><span class="dashboard-category-badge">${escapeHtml(model.category)}</span></div>
                                                                                            <strong>${escapeHtml(model.name)}</strong>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-product-serial">SN : ${escapeHtml(model.serial)}</span>
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-product-meta"><span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i><span><small>Jumlah</small><b>${model.quantity} ${model.unit}</b></span></span><span class="inventory-meta-item"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i><span><small>Lokasi</small><b>${escapeHtml(model.location)}</b></span></span></div>
                                                                                            <span class="inventory-product-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>${escapeHtml(model.note)}</span>
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                        <div class="inventory-list-side">
                                                                                            <div class="inventory-list-side-top"><time>Tanggal - ${escapeHtml(model.date)}</time><span class="inventory-card-condition ${model.damaged ? 'is-damaged' : 'is-good'}">${escapeHtml(model.condition)}</span></div>
                                                                                            ${renderInventoryActions(model, false)}
                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </article>`).join('') : '';

                                                                                tbody.innerHTML = '';
                                                                                bindInventoryItemInteractions();
                                                                            }

                                                                            function renderInventoryError(message) {
                                                                                const content = `<div class="inventory-empty-state is-error"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle"></i><strong>Gagal memuat inventaris</strong><span>${escapeHtml(message)}</span></div>`;
                                                                                document.getElementById('inventoryGridView').innerHTML = content;
                                                                                document.getElementById('inventoryCompactView').innerHTML = content;
                                                                                document.getElementById('inventoryListView').innerHTML = content;
                                                                                document.getElementById('inventoryTableBody').innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="8" class="dashboard-empty dashboard-error">${escapeHtml(message)}</td></tr>`;
                                                                            }

                                                                            function bindInventoryItemInteractions() {
                                                                                document.querySelectorAll('[data-item-index].inventory-product-card, [data-item-index].inventory-compact-card, [data-item-index].inventory-list-card, .dashboard-item-row[data-item-index]').forEach(element => {
                                                                                    element.addEventListener('click', event => {
                                                                                        if (event.target.closest('a, button')) return;
                                                                                        openDetailModalByIndex(Number(element.dataset.itemIndex));
                                                                                    });
                                                                                    element.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
                                                                                        if (event.key !== 'Enter' && event.key !== ' ') return;
                                                                                        if (event.target.closest('a, button')) return;
                                                                                        event.preventDefault();
                                                                                        openDetailModalByIndex(Number(element.dataset.itemIndex));
                                                                                    });
                                                                                });
                                                                            }

                                                                            function openDetailModalByIndex(index) {
                                                                                const item = currentInventoryItems[index];
                                                                                if (item) openDetailModal(item);
                                                                            }

                                                                            function renderPagination(totalPages, page) {
                                                                                const container = document.getElementById('paginationContainer');
                                                                                if (totalPages <= 1) { container.innerHTML = ''; return; }
                                                                                const pages = [];
                                                                                const start = Math.max(1, Math.min(page - 2, totalPages - 4));
                                                                                const end = Math.min(totalPages, start + 4);
                                                                                pages.push(`<li class="page-item ${page === 1 ? 'disabled' : ''}"><button class="page-link" type="button" onclick="loadDashboardData(${page - 1})"><i class="bi bi-chevron-left"></i><span>Prev</span></button></li>`);
                                                                                for (let value = start; value <= end; value++) pages.push(`<li class="page-item ${value === page ? 'active' : ''}"><button class="page-link" type="button" onclick="loadDashboardData(${value})">${value}</button></li>`);
                                                                                pages.push(`<li class="page-item ${page === totalPages ? 'disabled' : ''}"><button class="page-link" type="button" onclick="loadDashboardData(${page + 1})"><span>Next</span><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></button></li>`);
                                                                                container.innerHTML = pages.join('');
                                                                            }

                                                                            function renderCategories(categories) {
                                                                                const list = document.getElementById('categoryDropdownList');
                                                                                const buttons = [{ value: '', label: 'Semua Kategori' }, ...categories.map(value => ({ value, label: value }))];
                                                                                list.innerHTML = buttons.map(item => `<li><button class="dropdown-item ${item.value === currentCategory ? 'active-category' : ''}" type="button" data-value="${escapeHtml(item.value)}">${escapeHtml(item.label)}</button></li>`).join('');
                                                                                list.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => selectCategory(button.dataset.value, button.textContent.trim())));
                                                                            }

                                                                            async function renderActivityLogs(logs) {
                                                                                const tbody = document.getElementById('activityLogTableBody');
                                                                                if (typeof replaceNotificationItemIds === 'function') logs = await replaceNotificationItemIds(logs);
                                                                                if (!logs?.length) { tbody.innerHTML = '<tr><td colspan="4" class="dashboard-empty">Belum ada aktivitas terbaru.</td></tr>'; return; }
                                                                                tbody.innerHTML = logs.slice(0, 8).map(log => {
                                                                                    const time = new Date(log.waktu || log.Waktu).toLocaleString('id-ID', { day: '2-digit', month: 'short', year: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' });
                                                                                    const action = log.aksi || log.Aksi || 'Aktivitas';
                                                                                    const target = log.target || log.Target || '';
                                                                                    const detail = log.detail || log.Detail || '-';
                                                                                    const tone = getActivityTone(`${action} ${target} ${detail}`);
                                                                                    return `<tr class="activity-log-row activity-log-${tone}"><td class="text-nowrap">${escapeHtml(time)}</td><td><strong>${escapeHtml(log.actorDisplay || log.ActorDisplay || 'System')}</strong></td><td><span class="activity-action-badge activity-${tone}">${escapeHtml(`${action}${target}`.trim())}</span></td><td>${escapeHtml(detail)}</td></tr>`;
                                                                                }).join('');
                                                                            }

                                                                            function getActivityTone(value) {
                                                                                const text = String(value || '').toLowerCase();
                                                                                if (/(terlambat|ditolak|menolak|tolak|gagal|dihapus|menghapus|hapus|rusak)/.test(text)) return 'danger';
                                                                                if (/(disetujui|menyetujui|setujui|memvalidasi|berhasil|selesai|dikembalikan|kembali)/.test(text)) return 'success';
                                                                                if (/(menunggu|pending|jatuh tempo|peringatan)/.test(text)) return 'warning';
                                                                                if (/(menambahkan|tambah|dibuat|masuk|memperbarui|mengubah|edit)/.test(text)) return 'info';
                                                                                return 'neutral';
                                                                            }

                                                                            function selectCategory(value, label) {
                                                                                currentCategory = value || '';
                                                                                document.getElementById('selectedCategoryText').textContent = label || 'Semua Kategori';
                                                                                loadDashboardData(1);
                                                                            }

                                                                            function handleSearchSubmit(event) {
                                                                                event.preventDefault();
                                                                                window.clearTimeout(searchDebounceTimer);
                                                                                currentSearch = document.getElementById('searchStringInput').value.trim();
                                                                                loadDashboardData(1);
                                                                            }
    
                                                                            // --- FUNGSI FILTER DASHBOARD YANG SUDAH DIPERBARUI ---
                                                                            function filterDashboard(category, search, filter) {
                                                                                currentCategory = category || '';
                                                                                currentSearch = search || '';
                                                                                currentFilter = filter || '';
                                                                                document.getElementById('selectedCategoryText').textContent = currentCategory || 'Semua Kategori';
        
                                                                                // Logika dinamis untuk menampilkan teks alert berdasarkan filter aktif
                                                                                const alertText = document.getElementById('filterAlertText');
                                                                                if (currentFilter === 'rusak') {
                                                                                    alertText.innerHTML = '<i class="bi bi-funnel-fill"></i> Menampilkan barang kondisi rusak.';
                                                                                } else if (currentFilter === 'low-stock') {
                                                                                    alertText.innerHTML = '<i class="bi bi-funnel-fill"></i> Menampilkan item dengan stok menipis.';
                                                                                }

                                                                                document.getElementById('filterAlertBox').classList.toggle('d-none', !currentFilter);
                                                                                loadDashboardData(1);
                                                                                document.querySelector('.dashboard-inventory-panel')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
                                                                            }
                                                                            // -----------------------------------------------------

                                                                            function resetFilterRusak() {
                                                                                currentFilter = '';
                                                                                document.getElementById('filterAlertBox').classList.add('d-none');
                                                                                loadDashboardData(1);
                                                                            }

                                                                            async function deletePerangkat(id) {
                                                                                const confirmation = await Swal.fire({ title: 'Arsipkan perangkat?', text: 'Perangkat akan dipindahkan ke arsip inventaris.', icon: 'warning', showCancelButton: true, confirmButtonText: 'Ya, arsipkan', cancelButtonText: 'Batal', confirmButtonColor: '#ed1b2f' });
                                                                                if (!confirmation.isConfirmed) return;
                                                                                const response = await fetch(`/api/perangkat/${id}`, { method: 'DELETE', credentials: 'include' });
                                                                                if (response.ok) { await Swal.fire('Berhasil', 'Perangkat dipindahkan ke arsip.', 'success'); loadDashboardData(currentPage, true); }
                                                                                else Swal.fire('Gagal', 'Perangkat belum dapat diarsipkan.', 'error');
                                                                            }

                                                                            function openDetailModal(item) {
                                                                                const imageUrl = resolveImage(item.dokumentasi);
                                                                                setText('modal-nama', item.nama || '-'); setText('modal-kategori', item.kategori || 'Perangkat ICT Operation'); setText('modal-kondisi', item.kondisi || 'Baik');
                                                                                setText('modal-jumlah', `${item.jumlah || 0} ${item.kategori === 'Tinta / Toner / Cartridge' ? 'Pcs' : 'Unit'}`); setText('modal-lokasi', item.namaLokasi || item.lokasi?.namaLokasi || '-');
                                                                                setText('modal-vendor', item.namaVendor || '-'); setText('modal-status', item.statusSewa || '-'); setText('modal-keterangan', item.keterangan || '-');
                                                                                setText('modal-tanggal-masuk', item.createdAt ? new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('id-ID', { day: '2-digit', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) : '-');
                                                                                const image = document.getElementById('modal-gambar');
                                                                                const fallback = document.getElementById('modal-no-gambar');
                                                                                const imageOpen = document.getElementById('modal-image-open');
                                                                                image.hidden = !imageUrl;
                                                                                fallback.hidden = Boolean(imageUrl);
                                                                                imageOpen.hidden = !imageUrl;
                                                                                if (imageUrl) {
                                                                                    image.src = imageUrl;
                                                                                    image.onerror = () => { image.hidden = true; fallback.hidden = false; imageOpen.hidden = true; };
                                                                                    imageOpen.onclick = () => window.open(imageUrl, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
                                                                                }
                                                                                const laptop = String(item.kategori || '').toLowerCase().includes('laptop');
                                                                                const specs = document.getElementById('modal-laptop-specs');
                                                                                specs.classList.toggle('d-none', !laptop);
                                                                                if (laptop) {
                                                                                    setText('modal-type', item.typeLaptop || '-');
                                                                                    setText('modal-product-id', item.productId || '-');
                                                                                    const serials = String(item.snLaptop || '').split(/[,;\n]+/).map(value => value.trim()).filter(Boolean);
                                                                                    document.getElementById('modal-serials').innerHTML = serials.length
                                                                                        ? serials.map(value => `<span>${escapeHtml(value)}</span>`).join('')
                                                                                        : '<span class="serial-empty">Serial number belum tersedia</span>';
                                                                                }
                                                                                bootstrap.Modal.getOrCreateInstance(document.getElementById('detailModal')).show();
                                                                            }

                                                                            function resolveImage(value) { if (!value) return ''; if (/^https?:\/\//i.test(value) || value.startsWith('/api/files/')) return value; const fileName = value.replace(/^.*[\\/]/, ''); return `/api/files/perangkat?fileName=${encodeURIComponent(fileName)}`; }
                                                                            function setText(id, value) { const node = document.getElementById(id); if (node) node.textContent = value; }
                                                                            function setSearchState(value) { setText('searchState', value); }
                                                                            function escapeHtml(value) { return String(value ?? '').replaceAll('&', '&amp;').replaceAll('<', '&lt;').replaceAll('>', '&gt;').replaceAll('"', '&quot;').replaceAll("'", '&#039;'); }
                                                                        </script>
                                                                    }
